  "upload_type": "dataset",
  "title": "Humanities Data Benchmark: complete stored results",
  "description": "<p>Every stored result of the Humanities Data Benchmark as joinable tables: 3,805 runs, 166,380 requests and 3,902,043 metric observations covering data through 2026-10-29. Apart from the framework's own test benchmarks, nothing is filtered: unscored, failed and unresolved runs are rows carrying a status rather than omissions.</p><p>Tables in Parquet, a metric dictionary, coverage, diagnostics and a source manifest, with the original request and scoring JSON as gzipped JSON Lines. See README.md and CHANGELOG.md.</p>",
